</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border:1px solid #ddd;">TC-CMP-002</td>
<td style="border:1px solid #ddd;">Submit book 1 second after competition <code>endDate</code></td>
<td style="border:1px solid #ddd;">400 Bad Request — server UTC time used, not client</td>
